      "statement": "composeChunk builds a request counter (or uses the session's shared one) and a fresh trade governor of two sibling clients over one HttpPort, counted as league-validation and tracked-list (plus a session-probe port when an auth holder is given), and a load hook that reads config, checks the pinned cap, reads currencies and item types, and returns the publication, starvation record, league gate and pricing step; pnpm sync, pnpm sync:batch and pnpm sync:dry all use it.",
